## 1. The question left by the central benchmark

H4-T1 gives one exact same-source reduction with central curvature. Central
curvature is special: its adjoint/Lie shadow vanishes and curvature insertions
can be harmless. A genuine curved-transfer test must have

```text
d_Q^2=ad_F !=0
```

