## 6. Explicit perturbation resolvent

Separate

```text
Q_A=Q_0+delta,
Q_0=d tensor 1,
delta=Gamma_A tensor q.
```

The perturbation really interacts with the eliminated pair: both `h delta` and
`delta h` are nonzero. Nevertheless,

```text
